  {
   "castId": 3080,
   "name": "NOM1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\nYou folks are very brave, but no one can survive out here without money to buy food and supplies. I collected $100.00 from your neighbors to help you through the winter. I'm sure you would do the same for us.\n"
  },
  {
   "castId": 3081,
   "name": "NoM2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\nTake money out of the box under your bed."
  },
  {
   "castId": 3082,
   "name": "NoM3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": " \nAfter all your hard work, it's a shame not to sell your crops. It's no wonder that you ran out of money. I think you should sell your crops right away.\n"
  },
  {
   "castId": 3083,
   "name": "NoM4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Hello, neighbor. You look as though you could use some advice. You can use your homestead claim as security to borrow money from the bank.\n\n"
  },
  {
   "castId": 3084,
   "name": "NOM5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\nI'm sorry to hear that you're heading back east. We heard that you ran out of money. I collected $50.00 from your neighbors to help pay for your journey. I hope you'll come back next year and try again. "
  },
  {
   "castId": 3085,
   "name": "NOM6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\nI'm sorry to hear that you're heading back east. We heard that you ran out of money. I hope you'll come back next year and try again. "
  },
  {
   "castId": 3110,
   "name": "",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "March, 1880\nWe're ready to say good-bye to city life on the\nEast Coast.  We'll travel first by train and then \nby covered wagon to the High Plains of Kansas.\nOnce we're there, we'll  stake a claim for a \nhomestead of 160 acres. Our family is ready to\ngo west and make a new start!"
  },
  {
   "castId": 3111,
   "name": "",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "March, 1880\nWe're ready to say good-bye to city life on the\nEast Coast.  We'll travel first by train and then \nby covered wagon to the High Plains of Kansas.\nOnce we're there, we'll  stake a claim for a \nhomestead of 160 acres. Our family is ready to\ngo west and make a new start!"
  },
  {
   "castId": 3112,
   "name": "MyText",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "March, 1880\nWe're ready to say good-bye to city life on the East Coast.  We'll travel first by train and then by covered wagon to the High Plains of Kansas. Once we're there, we'll stake a claim for a homestead of 160 acres. Our family is ready to go west and make a new start!"
  },
  {
   "castId": 3113,
   "name": "",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "April, 1880\nWe've finally made it to Kansas!  We've found a  good spot for our homestead, not far from a creek  and a small town.  Until we build a house, we're  living in a tent made from the top of our covered wagon.  Once we get settled, we'll get ready to farm our homestead."
  },
