   "castId": 3257,
   "name": "NewHouse",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Hi, neighbor. Did you know that you can afford some new furniture for your house? It will help make even the plainest sod house prettier. New furniture costs $200.00. Would you like to buy it?\n"
  },
  {
   "castId": 3263,
   "name": "NH1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Hi, neighbor. Did you know that you can afford some new furniture for your house? It will help make even the plainest sod house prettier. New furniture costs $200.00. Would you like to buy it?\n"
  },
  {
   "castId": 3264,
   "name": "NH2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Hi, neighbor. Did you know that you can afford a ready-made wooden house? It is more comfortable and spacious than a sod house. A ready-made wooden house costs $1,000.00. Would you like to buy it?\n"
  },
  {
   "castId": 3265,
   "name": "PutIn",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "You have $0.00\nin your savings box.\nHow much money \ndo you want to put in?\n\n"
